{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04763","headline":"奉酬韦祭酒自汤还都经龙门北溪庄见贻之作 · 张说","name":"奉酬韦祭酒自汤还都经龙门北溪庄见贻之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君汤井至，潇洒憇郊林。\n拂曙携清赏，披云觏绿岑。\n欢言游览意，款曲望归心。\n是日期佳客，同山忽异寻。\n桃花迂路转，杨柳间门深。\n泛舟伊水涨，系马香树阴。\n繁弦弄水族，娇吹狎沙禽。\n春满汀色媚，景斜岚气侵。\n怀仁殊未远，重德匪专临。\n来藻敷幽思，连词报所钦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}